===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|fr}} {{m|frm|esteindre}}, {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{m|fro|estaindre}} < {{etyl|la|fr}} {{m|la|extinguere}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|extinguō}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Fr-éteindre.ogg|audio|lang=fr}}
* {{IPA|/e.tɛ̃dʁ/|lang=fr}}

===Verb===
{{fr-verb}}

# to [[turn off]] (a switch)
# to [[put out]] (a fire)
# {{lb|fr|reflexive}} to [[die out]], [[fade]]

